      <text class="small-label" x="400" y="405" text-anchor="middle">Each token "looks at" every other token and decides how relevant each is.</text>
      <text class="small-label" x="400" y="425" text-anchor="middle">This happens in parallel across all tokens, then repeats through many layers.</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>FIG 4.1 — Transformers use multi-layer attention: each token looks at all others, decides relevance, and updates its representation. This repeats through stacked layers.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

